{"id":"seda","lemma":"seda","pos":"noun","rank":2909,"glosses":["silk (fine fiber excreted by the silkworm or other arthropod)","silk (fine, soft cloth woven from silk fibers)","thin string (long, very thin, and flexible structure made from threads twisted together)"],"ipa":"/ˈseda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sedas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-seda.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿En dónde puedo comprar seda?","en":"Where can I buy silk?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453777","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to buy"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"synonym of dónde"]]},{"text":"Esto se siente como seda.","en":"This feels like silk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800851","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"as"},null]},{"text":"Parece seda.","en":"This looks like silk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454938","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},null]},{"text":"Este vestido está hecho de seda pura.","en":"This dress is made from pure silk.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"dressed"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"pure, clear","l":"puro"}]},{"text":"Llevaba una bolsa de seda.","en":"She carried a silk purse.","words":[{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bag"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}